  era: "12th\u201317th c. CE \xB7 Section 15 \xB7 Bhakti and Sufi Movements \xB7 c. 6th \u2013 17th century"
  title: Bhakti saints
  text: 'Bhakti saints taught that sincere devotion matters more than ritual or caste. Across regions they sang in local languages: Basavanna in Kannada; Jnaneshwar, Namdev and Tukaram in Marathi; Tulsidas and Surdas in Hindi; and many more.'
